       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZPRT.
      * Starts ZPR2 at printer PRT1 now and after a second, with data.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-MSG    PIC X(20) VALUE 'HELLO PRINTER'.
       01 WS-LATER  PIC X(20) VALUE 'PRINTED LATER'.
       01 WS-RESP   PIC S9(8) COMP.
       01 WS-OUT    PIC X(40).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC CICS START TRANSID('ZPR2') TERMID('PRT1')
                FROM(WS-MSG) LENGTH(20) RESP(WS-RESP) END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS START TRANSID('ZPR2') TERMID('PRT1')
                AFTER SECONDS(1)
                FROM(WS-LATER) LENGTH(20) END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS START TRANSID('ZPR2') TERMID('NONE')
                RESP(WS-RESP) END-EXEC
           IF WS-RESP = DFHRESP(TERMIDERR)
              MOVE 'PRINT REQUESTED, TERMIDERR OK' TO WS-OUT
           ELSE
              MOVE 'TERMIDERR MISSING' TO WS-OUT
           END-IF
           EXEC CICS SEND TEXT FROM(WS-OUT) LENGTH(40) ERASE END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
